# Frontend stack

The UI for this product is the `quickerpay-web` repository. It is Next.js 15 App Router, TypeScript, and Tailwind 3.

Do not create another frontend. Do not offer CRA, Craco, Vite SPA, React Router, or JavaScript-only as a faster path. `docs/00_START_HERE.md` section 8 locked this stack. Substituting it is a spec break, not a template choice.

Next.js never talks to PostgreSQL or Redis. Data comes from NestJS over the same-origin `/api/v1` rewrite in `docs/08_ARCHITECTURE.md` section 3.

Before writing UI, read `docs/09_FRONTEND.md` in `quickerpay-api` and follow `.cursor/skills/build-web-screen/SKILL.md` in `quickerpay-web`.
